"\n"
"* Inactive data can not be selected when creating new transaction\n"
"* Transaction with inactive master data can still be viewed\n"
"* Set master data as inactive if master data no longger needed,\n"
"but master data already used on transaction"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift.field_hr_attendance_shift__code
msgid ""
"Master data unique identifier.\n"
"\n"
"* Fill with '/' if You do not need unique identifier\n"
"* Click 'Generate Code' button to automatically assign code.\n"
"  Sequence template mush be set to perform this action\n"
"  Only master data with '/' code will be assign automatic code"
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift.field_hr_attendance_shift__late_check_out_tolerance
msgid ""
"Matching window, in hours, after the shift end within which an attendance "
"check-out is still considered part of this shift. This is not a lateness "
"policy — see Early Check In Tolerance."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_timesheet_attendance_shift.field_hr_attendance_shift__early_check_in_tolerance
msgid ""
"Matching window, in hours, before Work From within which an attendance "
"check-in is still considered part of this shift. This is not a lateness "
"policy: lateness itself is still computed from the raw time difference by "
"hr.timesheet_attendance_schedule."
msgstr ""

